", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_1840524873122821_3055739933188055904_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KJxqvm7WuTAQ7kNvwF0vpC1&_nc_oc=Adp83Bcj1nr1TZSTzGmOszF95dx8kHYRcHwCb65ori6RpA9rlgo3mgeYTIuVyD1ELNA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afzp669O-1T8-T8fMAwDR020LhKykHtsU2I4OkKjJWNTbg&oe=69CBCE79"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "3474397939524850", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974494_3474397942858183_7325370313459975246_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6i-RVCvdstwQ7kNvwFBGwZO&_nc_oc=Adp6R7D6UCK61GiPalPYbDcSFUI4zG82oI5TNo44SSHUMQaCwLJ0rl3kryS_Bty54xk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwKuGMAh3GxMkuwi7nzzzVJAFcVk9XVKphcNfpfjpd5Iw&oe=69CBAD0B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hard Drive Logo (6).png", "id": "1060475455596738", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_1060475458930071_8663595066419356644_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=w-kwzgJuSFEQ7kNvwGzFe6y&_nc_oc=AdoVY34kpnvwXxBbRluvN6Js3bac9ThKwciMKoLthXqfZ0_YmSF1fCMWQlDLg_6EUt8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfyzI7f5rI6CeS__JGCRmmjHUcRAbM2lvrgc5goHUG88jw&oe=69CBAB8E"}, "display_name": "Hard Drive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# *Hard Drive* \n\nHard Drive is a fast-paced, multiplayer, competitive electro combat driving game. Players control sleek, neon-lit motorcycle looking vehicles, known as bykes, which leave behind a temporary solid trail of light as they move. Players must outmaneuver their opponents by creating a trails of light that they cannot avoid crashing into, while avoiding the trails left by other players.\n\n# _Current Features_\n- Non PvP Driving Park\n- 6 Player Combat Arena\n- Season Pass with Progression Rewards\n- Cosmetic Shop \n\n## More Coming Soon. . .", "short_description": "Electro Combat Driving "}]}, "devel